<title>USA: UST CFO and U.S. Tobacco president resign.</title>
<headline>UST CFO and U.S. Tobacco president resign.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UST Inc said chief financial officer John Bucchignano and executive vice president Robert Rothenberg have resigned, citing philosophical differences about the strategic direction of the company.</p>
<p>The company said Rothenberg was also president at its United States Tobacco Co subsidiary.</p>
<p>No successors have been named at this time, UST said.</p>
</text>
